flowchart TD
  User([Caregiver])
  Web[Next.js dashboard\napps/web]
  Api[FastAPI on Cloud Run\npackages/api]
  Job[Nightly Cloud Run Job\npackages/jobs]
  Store[(Firestore\nusers/uid/**)]
  Vertex[Gemini 3.5\nvia Vertex AI]
  Cal[Google Calendar API]
  Gmail[Gmail API]
  Browser[Browser\nWeb Speech API]

  User -->|"HTTPS + cookie"| Web
  Web -->|"/v1/*"| Api
  Web <-->|"mic + TTS"| Browser

  Api -->|"read/write"| Store
  Api -->|"events + watch"| Cal
  Api -->|"send"| Gmail
  Api -->|"call_agent\n(structured JSON,\nsource_span guard,\ncost cap)"| Vertex

  Cal -->|"push"| Webhook[/v1/calendar/webhook/]
  Webhook --> Api

  subgraph Agents [ADK agents]
    Router[ChatRouterAgent]
    Role[RoleAgent]
    Usual[UsualAgent]
    Activity[ActivityAgent]
    Priority[PriorityAgent]
    Reminder[ReminderAgent]
    Email[EmailAgent]
    Summary[SummaryAgent]
  end
  Api --> Agents
  Agents --> Vertex

  Job -->|"nightly recompute\n+ TTL + watch renew"| Store
  Job --> Cal
